From 73e9d7949e59569436afe06cc073c24ba8f3b5fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add dwc2d, a DWC2 USB host controller driver (first
 stage)

Brings up the Synopsys DesignWare USB 2.0 controller of the Raspberry Pi
in host mode with buffer DMA, resets the root port and enumerates the
device behind it with control transfers. Polling only, and it does not
offer the USB scheme to class drivers yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
